# BC250 category: experiments
# Ollama model: exp-lfm3-1.7b-liquidai-q6-k
# Acquisition/capability metadata: models/model-catalog.json
# Official LFM3 Q6_K quality-first compact office/task challenger.
FROM __BC250_SOURCE__
PARAMETER num_gpu 99
PARAMETER num_keep 256
PARAMETER num_ctx 32768
PARAMETER temperature 0.1
PARAMETER top_p 1.0
PARAMETER top_k 50
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.1
SYSTEM """You are an experimental multilingual office assistant. Respond in German, French, or English according to the user's request. Be concise and practical, preserve names, numbers, dates, constraints, and requested output structure, and state uncertainty instead of inventing information."""
